/Title (An\040algebraic\040formulation\040of\040Thurston\220s\040characterization\040of\040rational\040functions)
/Author (Kevin\040M\056\040Pilgrim)
/Subject (Following\040Douady\055Hubbard\040and\040Bartholdi\055Nekrashevych\054\040we\040give\040an\040algebraic\040formulation\040of\040Thurston\047s\040characterization\040of\040rational\040functions\056\040The\040techniques\040developed\040are\040applied\040to\040the\040analysis\040of\040the\040dynamics\040on\040the\040set\040of\040free\040homotopy\040classes\040of\040simple\040closed\040curves\040induced\040by\040a\040rational\040function\056\040The\040resulting\040finiteness\040results\040yield\040new\040information\040on\040the\040global\040dynamics\040of\040the\040pullback\040map\040on\040Teichmuller\040space\040used\040in\040the\040proof\040of\040the\040characterization\040theorem\056)
/Keywords (28\040Jan\0402013\054\040Annales\040de\040la\040Faculté\040des\040Sciences\040de\040Toulouse\054\040Rational\040function\054\040Algebraic\040number\054\040Homotopy\054\040Pullback\054\040Simple\040\050abstract\040algebra\051)
